[[3,47,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the bolts.</p><p>2. Move the fog lamp and support slightly.</p><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Left fog lamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890292\">F15</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Right fog lamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890295\">F16</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Recover the fog lamp and support.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035444.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,47,0,"<p>1. If necessary, undo the bolts (1a) and separate the fog lamp (1b)\nfrom the support (1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035445.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,47,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Test the electrical operation\nof the fog lamp.</p><p>If separated, position the fog lamp on\nthe support.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Position the fog lamp in its housing.</p><p>Tighten the bolts.</p><p>If necessary, Carry out Op. \n                                          <a href=\"#/2891940\">5540D38</a></p>"]]